      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b0984bfa8436.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;UKMM Loot Randomizer Lite (Free)&lt;/h1&gt;Give your next &lt;strong&gt;Breath of the Wild&lt;/strong&gt; playthrough a different loot pool. Lite is a free, standalone randomizer for the &lt;strong&gt;Wii U version on Cemu&lt;/strong&gt;. It reads your active U-King Mod Manager profile and automatically includes eligible items from your enabled mods.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loot sliders&lt;/strong&gt; — Set a separate maximum of &lt;strong&gt;1–3 rewards&lt;/strong&gt; for chests, Koroks, barrels, crates, and Guardian wrecks.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monster randomization&lt;/strong&gt; — Shuffle the tiers, types, and equipped weapons of supported overworld monsters. Each option has its own toggle, and monster loot can be randomized separately.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shrine Spirit Orbs&lt;/strong&gt; — Set a maximum of up to &lt;strong&gt;10 Spirit Orbs&lt;/strong&gt; per completion for supported shrines outside the Great Plateau.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Progression rewards&lt;/strong&gt; — Required shrine keys and Korok Seeds are awarded separately from randomized loot. Modded chests keep their original reward and can receive bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reusable seeds&lt;/strong&gt; — Generate a new seed or enter one you want to reuse. All settings are on one screen.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;GameBanana Only Gets The Free Version Paid Version Available on Patreon Would Really Appreciate any and all Support for Further Development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
