    <item>
      <title>Over-the-Shoulder Camera (Auto Switch)</title>
      <author>Molybdenuw</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/744062</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/744062#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">95bb2f652a495bc8dd559a1f013f43a69fffcc10</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:09:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b02b14fece0f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b02b15008cc0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b02b2c086c08.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smart Shoulder Camera&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
An over-the-shoulder camera for Breath of the Wild that reacts to how you move. Push the stick hard to the side and the camera smoothly moves to the other shoulder. Walk along a wall and it switches sides on its own, then quickly returns to its normal position once you're in the open again.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Over-the-shoulder view instead of the centered default camera&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Automatic shoulder switching: strong sideways stick push, or a wall next to the camera&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Fast return to the normal distance after walls&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Adjustable in Cemu's graphic pack settings:&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Distance: 3.5 / 4.5 / 5.3 / 6.5 / 8 m&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Shoulder offset: 1.0 / 1.5 / 2.0 m&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Shoulder switch speed: Slow / Default / Fast / Very fast&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;BotW for Wii U, update 1.5.0 (v208), on Cemu&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;The stick is read from the Wii U GamePad input, so set your controller as &lt;strong&gt;Wii U GamePad&lt;/strong&gt; in Cemu's input settings&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Installation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Copy the &lt;code dir="ltr"&gt;BreathOfTheWild_ShoulderCam&lt;/code&gt; folder into Cemu's &lt;code dir="ltr"&gt;graphicPacks&lt;/code&gt; folder (usually &lt;code dir="ltr"&gt;%APPDATA%\Cemu\graphicPacks&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;In Cemu: &lt;strong&gt;Options → Graphic packs → The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild → Mods&lt;/strong&gt;, enable &lt;strong&gt;Shoulder Camera&lt;/strong&gt; and choose your presets.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Compatibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Disable &lt;strong&gt;Classic Camera&lt;/strong&gt; (and other mods that change camera settings): this mod includes its own camera settings.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Found a bug?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Please let me know in the comments! Screenshots and a short description of what happened (and which mods you're using) help a lot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/shouldercamera_release.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <category>Camera</category>
      <category>Camera</category>
    </item>
    <item>
