      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:10:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b029fc607a4c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6b029fc60b9f3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Left-Handed Legacy — Link &amp; Linkle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
For most of the series, Link was a lefty. This mod brings that tradition back to Breath of the Wild: both Link and Linkle now wield their weapons in the left hand and carry the shield on the right, just like in the classic Zelda games.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Weapons held and swung with the left hand&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Shield carried on the right arm&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;[Mirrored combat animations / sheathing / bow handling]&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Works for both Link and Linkle&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;BotW for Wii U, update 1.5.0 (v208), on Cemu&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;For Linkle: The Linkle Mod 3.0 and Girly Animation Pack&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Install with UKMM or BCML&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;strong&gt;Known issues&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul dir="ltr"&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;[Some animations or cutscenes may still show right-handed poses]&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;em&gt;Wield the sword the way heroes did in the old days.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Found a bug?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Please let me know in the comments! Screenshots and a short description of what happened (and which mods you're using) help a lot.</description>
